{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"d2897e3d853e01470ea3478104b28ddc852519ba0c031abb37012135602a1b7b","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"2485f3aada5a3e3b89c66fc9be4d0329e42ca2d1fb9369d9283adae96eff2c70","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"25cb7c7547d465dc0db21f90d09298ca068534443d59a347eed193ceb5a05040","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"281445cd08d6024690ff7a5f97d53d9df97dbc48cf4fbeabba0b509bde3aabb4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"术语：冻结术语 society.tsv:34（preferred）规定 Scourge from the West=西方天灾，译文作「来自西方大陆的英雄」。语义：第二段原文是鼓舞士气并给我们战胜太阳堡垒世代抵御的那股不可阻挡威胁的机会，译文改成「太阳堡垒……是我们胜利的最后希望和机会」，把太阳堡垒错当成希望本身；另把 nearly-unified 译成「统一」，丢了 nearly；还凭空添了「并亲自击败了他们」；「指定了一个计划」应为「制定」。"},{"revision_key":"2898f7eb9e2208a44a70d9baf54eac118b53b4f959082bbafc78b9ef8d113d0c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"29e41505488eedbe2a1f90930efa76801bd4d83453848aad83b2339493ad77fd","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"跨条及同条指称不一致：other.lua:649-652 通篇都是同一个 cannister（在 other.lua:591 定义为 toxic cannister，本批 2898f7eb 译作「罐子」）。本条第一句译成「罐子」，第 652 行 The cannister has %d life 却译成「发生器」，读起来像是另一个物体。"},{"revision_key":"2a7884fc91924cd8e75f1cd96e1832f9d73e2e00d4973631050e931aa5a16261","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"2a959ddc5fedb7e4596a02620748c04d014a5f21d0f68f51c8219de625aa0d29","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"2ac6341ecf834b6aab8396362229f67d3682a513b6134c7341ab3e3a6cc76b8a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"physical.lua:493 PAIN_ENHANCEMENT_SYSTEM 的 long_desc 原文是 All stats increased by %d，没有任何排除项；译文加了「除力量外」。冻结输入没给出该效果 activate 或对应技能的实现，无法佐证排除力量；缺这段证据时，这个限定是原文没有的机制内容。"}]}